<http://data.silknow.org/object/19958fe7-5afb-31b5-bc54-c9d00f35b89d>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Natural linen tabby-woven ground, embroidered with heavy floss silks in cross, herring-bone and fancy binding stitches giving a strong relief effect.  Both faces show borders of alternating dark red and blue-green leaf forms set at an angle. Narrow red and green borders; seams covered by narrow bands of pale green and yellow ochre fancy openwork stitchery. Linen stamped with mark on both faces. Stained and patched. Linen browned."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/fc6221ad-5126-3d11-8a1c-da2d21d9767d> ;
